<title>USA: H&amp;R Block closes $102 mln securitization.</title>
<headline>H&amp;R Block closes $102 mln securitization.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Block Financial Corp, a unit of H&amp;R Block Inc, said Thursday it closed a $102 million asset-backed security issue secured by home equity loans.</p>
<p>It said the securitization represents the first issue for Block Financial under a $1 billion public registration that became effective January 23, 1996.</p>
<p>The company expects that subsequent securitizations will complete the initial registration amount in about two years.</p>
<p>H&amp;R Block is a diversified company providing tax, financial and information services.</p>
<p>	   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
